{
  "english_translation": "A woman stands wearing a pink-and-white top, blue jeans, white shoes, pink socks, and a yellow, blue, and pink backpack. At a street intersection with black-and-white safety barriers, cars pass by and purple jacaranda blossoms carpet the roadside. Inside a jewellery shop, necklaces and earrings are displayed on white busts, while Apostolic church elders (Madzibaba) in white garments, red stoles, and staffs converse earnestly by a timber shelter.",
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "shona": "Mudzimai werudzi rwechichena akamira. Akapfeka nguwo yekumusoro ine ruvara rwepingi neruchena. Kuzasi akapfeka jinhi rebhuru. Kutsoka dzake akapfeka shangu dzine ruvara ruchena uyezve akapfeka masokisi ane ruvara rwepingi. Mudzimai uyu akabereka bhegi rine ruvara rweyero, bhuru nepingi.",
