    {
      "id": 2,
      "shona": "Mugwagwa miviri inemhararano. Mumwe mugwagwa urikufamba motokari. Mugwagwa urikufamba motokari uyu wakavharwa nemasimbi mapfupi ane ruvara rwuchena nerwutema Pane murume akazembera imwe simbi. Chitoro chinotengesa zvinhu zvokushongedza muviri zviri kuwonekwa pane pazvidhori zvichena muzasi zvakapfekedzwa manekiresi. Nechekumusoro kune amwe manekiresi ari kurembera zvimwe zviri kumudhuri zvakasangana nemhete.",
      "english": "At a road intersection lined with black-and-white barriers, cars pass by, while a jewellery shop displays necklaces and earrings on white busts and wall racks.",
      "literal_gloss": "Mugwagwa [in / singular gwagwa] • miviri [miviri] • inemhararano [inemhararano] • Mumwe [in / singular mwe] • mugwagwa [in / singular gwagwa] • urikufamba [you are famba] • motokari [car / vehicle] • Mugwagwa [in / singular gwagwa]",
