    {
      "id": 3,
      "shona": "Motikari mbiri dzine rudzi ruchena dziri kufamba mumugwagwa. Mujinga memugwagwa mune maruva akadonhera pasi epepuru. Madzibaba vakapfeka vanenguwo tsvuku muhuro nemudonzvo mutsvuku. Vakapfeka hembe dzeruvara ruchena nerepepoo. Vakamira panechimba chinoratidza kuti chakavakwa nemapango. Panemunhu wavarikutaura naye anoratidza kuti munhu wechitendero chavo vane zvavari kutsimbidzira kwaari. Vakapfeka nhumbi dzechitendero uye zvinechekuita nekunamata.",
      "english": "Two white cars drive along a road bordered by fallen purple flowers, while Apostolic church elders (Madzibaba) in white robes with red stoles and staffs speak with a fellow believer beside a pole-built shelter.",
      "literal_gloss": "Motikari [motikari] • mbiri [mbiri] • dzine [dzine] • rudzi [rudzi] • ruchena [white] • dziri [dziri] • kufamba [to / at famba] • mumugwagwa [in / singular mugwagwa]",
